  "scope": "PV-L01 Core disposition of internal legacy scalar evidence. Preserve existing private issuer/snapshot/seal semantics and public observation refusal. No opaque-field cast, marker promotion, automatic migration adapter, source/API/version change or new accepted owner scope.",
  "intentionalExtensions": "Private-to-public authority, raw lifetime and migration rules are explicit Bosak host policy beyond XDM representation. A future bridge requires actual public provider issuance, ownership, input/origin/environment and lifetime proof under refreshed immutable adoption; object shape or copied labels do not supply it. Private here means internal engine contracts, not a sibling licensing repository."
